<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="steve-github-avatar.png" name="Steve的F-Droid仓库" pubkey="" timestamp="1793138609" url="https://steve0309.dpdns.org/fdroid/repo" version="20002"><description>Steve 个人维护的 F-Droid 仓库，收录 FastSend、AppSpace 与票据 App。</description></repo><application id="com.example.appspace"><id>com.example.appspace</id><added>2026-10-27</added><lastupdated>2026-10-27</lastupdated><name>AppSpace</name><summary>Search Android apps across multiple app catalogs</summary><desc>AppSpace brings multiple third-party Android app catalogs into one search interface.

Features:
* Search F-Droid, GitHub Releases, Huawei AppGallery, vivo App Store, and Uptodown
* Rank results by relevance when source metadata allows it
* View app details and available version information
* Compare available download sources for matching apps
* Download APKs and use Android's installation flow
* No AppSpace account or sign-in required

Important notes:
* Catalog availability and download links are controlled by third-party services and may change.
* Search results do not guarantee that a working APK is available.
* Before installing an APK, verify the app name, developer, package name, and download source.
* Downloads from outside F-Droid have not been checked or built by F-Droid. Use care when choosing external sources.
* The optional Shizuku-assisted installation flow is experimental and requires separate setup and authorization.

AppSpace currently uses F-Droid as one of its search sources. This does not mean AppSpace itself is already included in the official F-Droid repository.</desc><license>Apache-2.0</license><categories>System</categories><category>System</category><web>https://steveyuanlong9321.github.io/AppSpace/</web><source>https://github.com/SteveYuanlong9321/AppSpace</source><tracker>https://github.com/SteveYuanlong9321/AppSpace/issues</tracker><author>SteveYuanlong9321</author><marketversion></marketversion><marketvercode>1</marketvercode><antifeatures>NonFreeNet</antifeatures><package><version>1.0</version><versioncode>1</versioncode><apkname>appspace-v1.0-app-release.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">1b22ca2376918eda0ab928137d5d1c711aab684265d0494591464d9a2cfd58da</hash><size>12846789</size><sdkver>26</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>37</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-10-27</added><sig>30cb405dd0c16346ef91db40db84ca88</sig><permissions>INTERNET,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES,REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES,com.example.appspace.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION,moe.shizuku.manager.permission.API_V23</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a,armeabi-v7a,x86,x86_64</nativecode></package></application><application id="app.fastsend"><id>app.fastsend</id><added>2026-10-27</added><lastupdated>2026-10-27</lastupdated><name>FastSend</name><summary>Cross-device file transfer</summary><desc>FastSend is an open-source Android file transfer app exploring multiple device discovery, connection negotiation, and transfer methods. Features and device compatibility depend on each release.
